---
description: Follow the repository-level AI context protocol
alwaysApply: true
---

Before non-trivial work, read `AGENTS.md` and follow its context restoration protocol.

Use `.ai/index.md` to navigate project memory.

Do not assume the current Cursor chat contains the full project state.

Do not treat `*-template.md` under `.ai/templates/` (or elsewhere) as an active task, ADR, or handoff.

Before modifying files, inspect existing Git working-tree changes and avoid silently overwriting work from other sessions.

After meaningful unfinished work, leave enough task/handoff state for another Agent to continue without relying on this chat.
